// ElaWidgetTools - embedded-source Qt Widgets library.
//
// Include this header from any number of translation units and compile
// ElaWidgetTools.cpp and ElaWidgetTools.qrc once in the application target.
// No implementation macro or separate library build step is required.
//
// AUTOMOC and AUTORCC are still required: the classes carry Q_OBJECT /
// Q_PROPERTY / signals and the qrc is compiled into the target.
//
// Late-bound helper methods are implemented in ElaWidgetTools.cpp, after all
// component classes have been declared.

